0,Mandobo language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mandobo_language,"July 29, 2025 - However, according to its speaker Mandobo is divided to at least three languages and four dialects. ... Below are some Kaeti reflexes of proto-Trans-New Guinea proposed by Pawley (2012), drawn from McElhanon and Voorhoeve (1970).",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
1,Indigenous people of New Guinea - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indigenous_peoples_of_New_Guinea,"4 weeks ago - The Indigenous peoples of Papua New Guinea and of Western New Guinea in Indonesia, commonly called Papuans, are Melanesians. There is genetic evidence for two major historical lineages in New Guinea and neighboring islands: a first wave from the Malay Archipelago perhaps 50,000 years ago when ...",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
2,Language: Mandobo Atas,http://transnewguinea.org/language/mandobo-atas?page=5,"Classification: Nuclear Trans New Guinea, Asmat-Awyu-Ok, Awyu-Ok, Greater Awyu, Awyu-Dumut, Dumut, Mandobo",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
3,(PDF) KERAGAMAN BAHASA MANDOBO DI PAPUA SELATAN: KAJIAN RAGAM BAHASA DAN KESALINGMENGERTIAN,https://www.researchgate.net/publication/384911245_KERAGAMAN_BAHASA_MANDOBO_DI_PAPUA_SELATAN_KAJIAN_RAGAM_BAHASA_DAN_KESALINGMENGERTIAN,"June 1, 2026 - Penelitian terkait dialektologi juga masih jarang dilakukan di Papua, salah satunya di komunitas penutur Mandobo Atas [aax] dan Mandobo Bawah [bwp] di kabupaten Boven Digoel. Kemudian, istilah Mandobo sebagai nama bahasa juga perlu dikonfirmasi lagi ke masyarakat (Farneubun 2002). Oleh karena itu, penelitian ini dilakukan untuk memahami fenomena-fenomena tersebut. Bahasa Mandobo secara linguistik diklasifikasikan ke dalam rumpun bahasa Trans-New Guinea dan tergabung dalam sub-keluarga Dumut bersama dengan bahasa lain seperti Ketum [ktt], Kombai [tyn], Wanggom [wng], dan Wambon [wms]. Penelitian ini mendalami ragam-ragam dalam Bahasa Mandobo berdasarkan topografi linguistik dan mengeksplorasi kesalingmengertian diantara ragam-ragam tersebut.",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
4,KERAGAMAN BAHASA MANDOBO DI PAPUA SELATAN: KAJIAN RAGAM BAHASA DAN KESALINGMENGERTIAN | Prosiding Konferensi Linguistik Tahunan Atma Jaya (KOLITA),https://ejournal.atmajaya.ac.id/index.php/kolita/article/view/5970,"September 28, 2024 - Penelitian terkait dialektologi juga masih jarang dilakukan di Papua, salah satunya di komunitas penutur Mandobo Atas [aax] dan Mandobo Bawah [bwp] di kabupaten Boven Digoel. Kemudian, istilah Mandobo sebagai nama bahasa juga perlu dikonfirmasi lagi ke masyarakat (Farneubun 2002). Oleh karena itu, penelitian ini dilakukan untuk memahami fenomena-fenomena tersebut. Bahasa Mandobo secara linguistik diklasifikasikan ke dalam rumpun bahasa Trans-New Guinea dan tergabung dalam sub-keluarga Dumut bersama dengan bahasa lain seperti Ketum [ktt], Kombai [tyn], Wanggom [wng], dan Wambon [wms]. Penelitian ini mendalami ragam-ragam dalam Bahasa Mandobo berdasarkan topografi linguistik dan mengeksplorasi kesalingmengertian diantara ragam-ragam tersebut.",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
5,Mandobo language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/mandobo_language,"January 17, 2026 - The Mandobo language is classified within the Trans–New Guinea phylum, specifically in the Greater Awyu family, as part of the Awyu–Dumut subgroup under the Dumut branch.[8] This placement positions Mandobo as a primary node in the Dumut languages, alongside closely related varieties. Mandobo is assigned ISO 639-3 codes bwp for the Bawah variety and aax for the Atas ...",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
6,Mandobo Atas | Ethnologue,http://www.ethnologue.com/show_language.asp?code=aax,"A language profile for Mandobo Atas. Get a detailed look at the language, from population to dialects and usage.",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
7,Mandobo Atas people group in all countries | Joshua Project,https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/19496,"Prayer Cards – Mandobo Atas · All Prayer Cards (2) -- OR -- Unreached Only Prayer Cards (0) Prayer cards are formatted eight to a page. Download Data · Population All Countries · 14,000 · People Cluster · New Guinea · Number of Countries · 2 · Number Unreached ·",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
8,"Category:Trans-New Guinea languages - Wiktionary, the free dictionary",https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Category:Trans-New_Guinea_languages,"Maiwa (New Guinea) language (0 c, 0 e) Makalero language (3 c, 0 e) Makasae language (3 c, 0 e) Makayam language (0 c, 0 e) Mandobo Atas language (2 c, 0 e) Mandobo Bawah language (2 c, 0 e) Menya language (2 c, 0 e) Mid Grand Valley Dani language (0 c, 0 e) Minanibai language (2 c, 0 e) Moikodi language (2 c, 0 e) Mountain Koiari language (3 c, 0 e) Mouwase language (0 c, 0 e) Mubami language (3 c, 0 e) Nabak language (1 c, 0 e) Nalca language (4 c, 0 e) Narak language (0 c, 0 e) Narau language (0 c, 0 e) Nawaru language (2 c, 0 e) Ndom language (4 c, 0 e) Nedebang language (2 c, 0 e) Nggem l",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
9,Sacred Flute Music From New Guinea: Madang / Windim Mabu | Ragnar Johnson assisted by Jessica Mayer | Ideologic Organ,https://ideologicorgan.bandcamp.com/album/sacred-flute-music-from-new-guinea-madang-windim-mabu,"April 28, 2025 - SOMA024 Sacred flutes are blown (""Windim Mambu'') to make the cries of spirits by adult men in the Madang region of Papua New Guinea. Pairs of long bamboo male and female flutes are played for ceremonies in the coastal villages near the Ramu River.",Mandobo Atas,Trans-New Guinea
